# Optional: copy to repo root as `.env` when running Docker Compose for local Redis only.
# Database: Supabase — configure DATABASE_URL in apps/api/.env (see docs/SUPABASE.md).
#
# App runtime config lives in each workspace:
#   apps/api/.env.example   -> apps/api/.env
#   apps/web/.env.local.example -> apps/web/.env.local